1	line	Bee dealer	Then you've come to the right place.
1	box	Out of nowhere, the dealer produces a rather insecure looking box.
1	line	Bee dealer	Before I hand you this box, I should tell you about proper insect handling.
1	line	Bee dealer	If they get annoyed, give them a shake. If they don't, don't ever shake them.
1	line	Player	That's it?
1	line	Bee dealer	That's it.
