0	section	Returning to Farmer Bea
1	line	Player	Here are your bees!
1	box	You hand over the box of disgruntled insects.
1	line	Farmer Bea	Great! I'll get these lovelies in their new 'ome. You wanna watch 'em move in?
1	line	Player	I'd be delighted!
1	line	Farmer Bea	Right, lets get these lil' fuzzy bumblers moved in.
# authored: the Wiki {{qact}} cutscene beat, shown as a box (cutscene not played)
1	box	Farmer Bea places the insects in the beehive. A swarm of wasps appears.
1	line	Player	Are they...?
1	line	Farmer Bea	Wasps?!
# authored: the Wiki {{qact}} cutscene beat, shown as a box (cutscene not played)
1	box	Two more swarms of wasps appear.
1	line	Player	They look mad!
1	line	Farmer Bea	Every farmer fer 'emself!
# authored: the Wiki {{qact}} cutscene beat, shown as a box (cutscene not played)
1	box	You and Farmer Bea run away from the wasps.
1	line	Farmer Bea	Wot kind o' bees turn inta wasps on transit!
1	line	Player	I'm not sure they were ever bees.
1	line	Farmer Bea	Well, I'd appreciate a bit more o ya help! Ain't got two bees t'rub togetha' and now we got wasps squattin' in me 'ives!
1	line	Player	How can I get rid of wasps?
1	line	Farmer Bea	Grab some kit outta me box 'ere. You'll need a net t'catch 'em, somethin' to protect yerself and a bit o' the ol' bug spray to calm 'em down.
1	line	Farmer Bea	Catch 50 o' the blighters to thin 'em out, then bring me some proof ya done it, right?
1	line	Player	Alright, I'll gear up and catch some wasps.
1	action	end
