1	line	Player	So you say these killer wasps are much worse than the normal ones?
# authored: the Wiki {{qact}} cutscene beat, shown as a box (cutscene not played)
1	box	A black honey buzzard flees from several swarms of killer wasps.
1	line	Farmer Bea	Yeah, I reckon they are...
1	line	Player	This bee dealer is leaving a lot to be desired.
1	line	Farmer Bea	I'm not gonna' get me 'oney am I?
1	line	Player	Doesn't look like it...
1	line	Farmer Bea	Do me another solid will ya? See if y'can make anythin' useful by puttin' those bird feathers 'n' stings you gathered togetha. Might be we can still achieve somethin' 'ere.
1	line	Player	Can't hurt to try.
1	action	end
