1	line	Farmer Bea	Well, at least we're makin' the best o' a bad job.
1	action	end
0	section	After crafting 50 wasp darts
1	line	Player	I've made 50 darts using the stings and feathers I gathered. I can't see myself ever having a use for them, but maybe someone else will want them.
1	line	Farmer Bea	Can probably sell 'em to the local guards. They ain't too picky with the gear they use. Feel free to give me any ya make an' I can pay yer back in useful supplies.
1	line	Player	Sounds good to me.
1	box	You glance around at the mess of insects and birds on the plot of land.
1	line	Player	It's certainly a unique farm we've created here.
1	line	Farmer Bea	It's a shame I won't get me 'oney, but at least we ain't come away with nothin'. Yer help's been wonderful, it has!
1	line	Player	Happy to be a part of it!
