# Appended: generated from the OSRS Wiki page "Transcript:Farmer Bea" by tools/quests/transcript_to_dialogue.py
0	section	Standard dialogue
1	line	Farmer Bea	Alright, me luvver!
1	select	Select an option
1	option	How's the farm going, Bea?
2	line	Player	How's the farm going Bea?
2	line	Farmer Bea	It's alright. Not surrounded by 'oney like what I intended, but I'm getting by.
2	line	Player	Good to hear! I suppose you won't mind if I hunt some more of your creatures?
2	line	Farmer Bea	Not at all. Take as many as yer like! Remember, if yer make more darts, I can swap 'em for stuff.
2	action	other
1	option	Do you have anything for sale?
2	line	Player	Do you have anything for sale?
2	line	Farmer Bea	I've got a stock o' hunting gear, given me farm seems t'revolve 'round it.
2	action	
1	option	Can I trade in some darts?
2	line	Player	Can I trade in some darts?
2	line	Farmer Bea	Yer can, but I'm 'fraid yer not got enough darts. For one supply bag it'll either be 35 wasp darts or 20 killer wasp darts.
2	action	other
1	option	Do you have any hunting tips for me?
2	line	Player	Do you have any hunting tips for me?
2	line	Farmer Bea	As it 'appens, the bloke who sold me the 'untin' stock fer me shop wouldn' stop talkin', so I picked a bit up. Got some local info, or further out. Whatcha wantin'?
2	select	Select an option
2	option	Could you tell me about hunting locally?
3	line	Player	Could you tell me about hunting locally?
3	line	Farmer Bea	Well, if yer want ye can hunt some more o' the birds an' wasps here. If ya don't fancy that, I 'eard lots o' funny coloured birds 'ave popped up recently in places not too far from 'ere.
3	line	Farmer Bea	Some north o' Al Kharid, some at Musa Point and a few north o' Falador. Apparently there's some butterflies at Falador as well.
3	line	Farmer Bea	Birds I reckon yer know 'ow to catch. An' for butterflies, just catch 'em like wasps, ya do. Need jars for 'em though.
3	action	other
2	option	Could you tell me about hunting further afield?
3	line	Player	Could you tell me about hunting further afield?
3	line	Farmer Bea	When ye have a bit o' experience, yer best bet is the Hunter Guild in Varlamore, I reckon. Else, there are a few big 'untin' grounds to try...
3	line	Farmer Bea	Piscatoris 'as a load o' woodland creatures to trap. If ya don't mind the cold, north of Rellekka there's plenty o' animals in the ice 'n' snow. Finally, the Feldip Hills 'as a lot of jungle critters for 'untin'.
3	action	other
2	option	Actually, let's talk about something else.
3	line	Player	Let's talk about something else.
3	action	initial
1	option	I'd best be off.
2	line	Player	I'd best be off.
2	action	end

